# Bring your own Supabase project (not Lovable Cloud).
#
# 1. Create a project at https://supabase.com (Dashboard -> New Project).
# 2. SQL Editor -> run db/schema.sql, then db/seed.sql (see file headers for
#    the demo auth users to create in Authentication -> Users first).
# 3. Project Settings -> API -> copy the Project URL and the anon/publishable key.
# 4. Set these two values as env vars in the Lovable editor (Secrets / env):

#
# Leave both blank to keep running the app in DEMO MODE — fully explorable,
# backed by the local seed dataset, no backend required.

